  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Reach Targeted Children and Youth with PEPFAR specified services in USAID PEPFAR Programs (RCAY)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The USAID PEPFAR Program (RCAY) goal is to reach and sustain HIV/AIDS epidemic control for pregnant women, children and adolescents by supporting them through targeted clinical, prevention and mitigation interventions. The program will also provide an avenue for countries to transition their prime awards to indigenous partners.</narrative>
  </description>
